{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-10_end",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-10",
  "title": "殘留",
  "storyCode": "1-10",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "132419b35ba7e04ebc84e0fc3dc7efc6d5a326be56ad38d832aa43f18435335c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經突破了整合運動的攔截！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是——他們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別讓阿米婭她們聽見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭心裡清楚得很！她比我們想像的成熟得多......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算這樣，也不能讓她聽見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再去加深她內心的煎熬是不明智的。她已經背負......太多東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不要讓......他們的努力白費！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然他們讓我們活下來，我們就應該讓博士和阿米婭......安全回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不是垂頭喪氣的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為耀騎士，無論在什麼時候，都該成為指引眾人的光吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我不清楚。但，我會去做我該做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重整隊形！不要懈怠！我們就快到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘴裡說著讓我放心的人，真的一個都沒回來過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}博士......？發生了......什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請，請放我......放我下來吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，沒問題我可以自己走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......失去意識了一會兒......沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們逃出來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ace他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的。如果是Ace的話，一定沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的大家，都是很強的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經，快到南方出口了。只要撤出切爾諾伯格，我們就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......能......讓我靠一下嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一下......一下就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難纏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然......能，能做到這一步......這傢伙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半個街區被燒成焦炭，整個廣場都陷入火海......鋼鐵被融化又重新凝固......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他為什麼......還能戰鬥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奮戰至屍骨無存——了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
